--//   failure : { valid = false, code = "invalid"|"expired"|"hwid_mismatch"|"blacklisted"|"rate_limited", message = "optional" }
--//   Echo `nonce` back and set Api.RequireNonce = true so a recorded "valid" reply can't be replayed.
--//   HTTP 429 counts as rate_limited, HTTP 5xx as a server error (retried automatically).

